NC_001890.1	RefSeq	CDS	56	1321	.	+	0	ID=cds-NP_046749.1;Parent=gene-MX1p1;Dbxref=GenBank:NP_046749.1,GeneID:1261501;Name=NP_046749.1;Note=Icosahedral Leviviridae virions contain 180 molecules of the coat protein and a single copy of the maturation protein%2C bound to the ssRNA genome. Binding of the maturation protein to genomic RNA may be the first step in assembly. In addition%2C the maturation protein in virions binds to the sides of host pili. Upon binding%2C it is cleaved and the RNA genome is released. Naked complexes of maturation protein and genomic RNA are infectious. other names: A protein.;gbkey=CDS;gene=mat;locus_tag=MX1p1;product=head maturation protease;protein_id=NP_046749.1;transl_table=11
