NC_001890.1	RefSeq	CDS	2351	4111	.	+	0	ID=cds-NP_046752.1;Parent=gene-MX1p4;Dbxref=GenBank:NP_046752.1,GeneID:1261500;Name=NP_046752.1;Note=The replicase holoenzyme of Leviviridae consists of the phage encoded replicase (the beta subunit)%2C as well as three host encoded proteins (alpha subunit: ribosomal protein S1%3B gamma subunit: EF-Tu%3B delta subunit: EF-Ts). The ribosomal protein S1 mediates binding of the holoenzyme to internal sites in the RNA%2C which allows the replicase to compete with translation for genomic RNA%2C since S1 also mediates the binding of the ribosome to the coat protein start site.;gbkey=CDS;gene=rep;locus_tag=MX1p4;product=RNA replicase beta subunit;protein_id=NP_046752.1;transl_table=11

